5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’ve seen programs stall when the underlying support wasn’t there. Let’s check the staffing and booking records first.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to see what the earlier attempts actually produced. Let’s look at the readmission figures and the board minutes.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to see where the pressure actually lands. I’ll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy staffing review.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Midori, checking staffing is a start, but it ignores the money. I’ll examine the development allocation and the regional fund tariffs.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about whether our space can handle more. I’ll look into the rooms and parking, and what the booking system records.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I’m glad we’re looking at the practical side. @Shion, do you think the tariffs will cover the ongoing costs of a new team?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, tariffs only show revenue. I need to know if the earlier trial actually changed patient outcomes before we spend more.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, tariffs are just revenue. I need to know if the staffing pressure is sustainable before we commit to anything.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, tariffs are the only revenue source. If the allocation is cut, we can’t afford the running costs. I’ll verify the ledger.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
