43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, on-site sessions bill at the standard rate. Home visits earn nothing. We must choose a program that stays within our walls to generate revenue.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, the booking system only records fixed slots. If a program doesn’t fit that rigid structure, it simply vanishes from our records.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, that’s a critical point. If it isn’t booked, it doesn’t exist. We need a model that fits our rigid systems, not one that breaks them.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, exactly. If it isn’t booked, it doesn’t exist. We need a model that fits our rigid systems, not one that breaks them.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
